<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Attention Computation using InnerQ</h2>

<div id="A1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Algorithms <a href="#alg1" title="Algorithm 1 ‣ Appendix A Attention Computation using InnerQ ‣ InnerQ: Hardware-aware Tuning-free Quantization of KV Cache for Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a> and <a href="#alg2" title="Algorithm 2 ‣ Appendix A Attention Computation using InnerQ ‣ InnerQ: Hardware-aware Tuning-free Quantization of KV Cache for Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2</span></a> describe the process of computing the attention using InnerQ in the prefill and decode phases.
We use a notation similar to PyTorch for indexing matrices in these algorithms.</p>
</div>
