<section id="A2" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix B </span>Full Latency Results</h2>

<div id="A2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We report the measured latencies corresponding to the speedups in Figures <a href="#S5.F3.sf1" title="In Figure 3 ‣ 5.3 Latency ‣ 5 Experiments ‣ InnerQ: Hardware-aware Tuning-free Quantization of KV Cache for Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3(a)</span></a> and <a href="#S5.F3.sf2" title="In Figure 3 ‣ 5.3 Latency ‣ 5 Experiments ‣ InnerQ: Hardware-aware Tuning-free Quantization of KV Cache for Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3(b)</span></a> in Tables <a href="#A2.T3" title="Table 3 ‣ Appendix B Full Latency Results ‣ InnerQ: Hardware-aware Tuning-free Quantization of KV Cache for Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a> and <a href="#A2.T4" title="Table 4 ‣ Appendix B Full Latency Results ‣ InnerQ: Hardware-aware Tuning-free Quantization of KV Cache for Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4</span></a>, respectively.</p>
</div>
